# Changelog

## [2.0.0] - 2026-01-07 - FSR 4.2.0 Support

### Added
- Support for FSR 4.2.0 upscaler
- Experimental frame generation option (FSR 4.2.0)
- Adaptive quality mode with target/min frame rate
- Custom preset support per game
- Improved Steam Deck-specific tuning
- Updated 9 game profiles
- Improved motion handling

### Changed
- Refreshed documentation and setup notes
- Minimum Proton version for FSR 4.2.0: 10.x+
- Minimum Mesa version for FSR 4.2.0: 24+
- GPU overhead reduced to 3-7% (from 5-10% in FSR 3.1)

### Migration
- Set `Upscaler=FSR420` and `FSRMode=Balanced` in OptiScaler.ini
- Roll back with `Upscaler=FSR31` if needed

